This directory holds Territorium's brand identity: its name, emblem, logos
and original audio. None of these assets come from OpenFront; the
OpenFront proprietary assets that shipped upstream were removed and are
not part of this repository.

The source code of Territorium is licensed under the GNU AGPL v3 (see
/LICENSE). That license covers code only. It grants NO rights to the
assets below, nor to the Territorium name.

1. ASSETS - ALL RIGHTS RESERVED (images/, sounds/)
   - images/Favicon.svg, images/TerritoriumEmblem.svg,
     images/TerritoriumLogo.svg,
     images/TerritoriumLogoLight.svg, images/Territorium.png,
     images/TerritoriumMark.png: the Territorium emblem and logos
   - sounds/music/menu-theme.mp3, sounds/music/gameplay.mp3,
     sounds/effects/game-start-alert.mp3: original audio

   You may run, build and test the official Territorium software
   containing these assets. You may NOT copy, modify, redistribute or
   extract them, or use them in any other project, product or service,
   without prior written permission.

